<title>ITALY: Italy Treasury cuts coupon on 3-yr, 5-yr BTPs.</title>
<headline>Italy Treasury cuts coupon on 3-yr, 5-yr BTPs.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Treasury said on Thursday it would cut the coupon on its three-year BTPs to 6.0 percent from 7.50 percent and on its three-year BTPs to 6.25 percent from 7.75 percent at its regular end-month auction.</p>
<p>The Treasury said it would issue three-, five- and 10-year BTPs and seven-year CCTs as normal but it did not announce the launch, which the market had been expecting, of a new 30-year fixed-rate bond.</p>
</text>
